"%@ moved %@%%. With a beta of %@, that alone predicts about %@%% for %@." = "%1$@ 变动了 %2$@%%。贝塔为 %3$@，仅此一项就预示 %5$@ 约变动 %4$@%%。";
"Company news" = "公司新闻";
"The most relevant headline points to a company-specific catalyst." = "最相关的新闻标题指向公司自身的催化因素。";
"Heavy trading" = "交易活跃";
"Volume was %@x normal, so this move had real conviction behind it." = "成交量是平常的 %@ 倍，说明这次波动背后有真正的信心。";
"No clear catalyst" = "没有明确的催化因素";
"Neither the market nor the headlines explain this move well." = "市场和新闻标题都无法很好地解释这次波动。";
"A %@ move is within %@'s typical daily range of ±%@%%. Nothing to act on." = "%1$@ 的波动处于 %2$@ 通常的日内波动范围（±%3$@%%）之内。无需采取行动。";
"The stock is moving in line with its sector. This is about the market, not the company." = "这只股票与其板块同步变动。这是市场的问题，而不是公司的问题。";
"A %@x-typical move with no clear headline. Could be flows, a rumor, or news not yet reported. Treat with caution." = "这是平常 %@ 倍的波动，却没有明确的新闻标题。可能是资金流动、传闻或尚未报道的消息。请谨慎对待。";
"Headlines lean the opposite way to the price. The market may be reacting to something else, or pricing in a second-order effect." = "新闻标题与价格方向相反。市场可能在对其他因素作出反应，或在消化二阶影响。";
"The news supports the direction, but a %@x-typical move on light volume looks stretched." = "新闻支持这一方向，但在成交清淡的情况下达到平常 %@ 倍的波动显得过度。";
"Heavy volume and supportive news, but the price has barely moved. The market may still be digesting it." = "成交量大、新闻利好，但价格几乎没动。市场可能仍在消化。";
"The move lines up with the news, its size is plausible for this stock, and volume confirms it." = "波动与新闻一致，幅度对这只股票来说合理，成交量也予以确认。";
